  "body": "An iconic Kerry Avery designed residence, capturing stunning unobstructed water and city views from Hobson Bay to the Sky Tower, with exceptional privacy and all-day sun.\r\n\r\n4 bedrooms, 2 ensuites and 1 bathroom, and a large open plan living area flowing to outdoor spaces featuring pool, spa, large deck, and incredible views. \r\n\r\nTreated timber, block base, plaster exterior, and aluminum joinery for durability and aesthetic appeal. \r\n\r\nAll nestled on 651sqm up a private driveway. Prepare to be captivated by the breathtaking views, abundant sunshine and incredible privacy that await you in this iconic home. Situated in one of the most sought-after positions in Orakei.",
